    <string name="how_it_works_point4_desc">Enable Shizuku or wireless debugging to set defaults with a single tap and confirmation toast.</string>
    <string name="shizuku_guide_title">How to Enable 1-Tap Apply</string>
    <string name="shizuku_guide_step1_title">1. Install Shizuku</string>
    <string name="shizuku_guide_step1_desc">Download Shizuku from Play Store or GitHub (free &amp; open-source).</string>
    <string name="shizuku_guide_step2_title">2. Start via Wireless Debugging</string>
    <string name="shizuku_guide_step2_desc">Enable Wireless Debugging in Developer Options and tap Start in Shizuku (no PC or root needed).</string>
    <string name="shizuku_guide_step3_title">3. Authorize Defaulty</string>
    <string name="shizuku_guide_step3_desc">Allow Defaulty access to ADB shell so it can apply defaults instantly with a single tap.</string>
